# The scratch directories the acquisition instruments write into. A search
# cache and a contact sheet of candidates nobody has chosen: somebody else's
# photographs with no register row, no hash and no date, which is exactly what
# the licence gate refuses. checks.py asserts the repository carries none.
.cache/
hero-sheet.png

# A THROWAWAY PROBE IS NOT A TOOL, AND `git add -A` CANNOT TELL. Measuring
# something here means writing a short Playwright script, and twice now a
# handful of them have been committed by accident — four in one commit, five
# in another — because they were sitting beside the instruments that are real.
# The convention is a leading dot; this makes the convention binding.
tools/**/.*.js
